const char *const text_pages[] = {
"The bells of the Undertown have gone\nquiet.",
"Without them the city forgets itself, one\nstreet at a time.",
"In a dusty loft, a small warden in a\nkite-shaped mask opens its eyes. Its\nname is Menuel.",
"Oh! You are awake, Menuel. Good. I am\ntoo old to climb.",
"Four bells keep this place alive.\nSomething has stolen their voices.",
"Take your axe. Wake the bells. Start in\nthe Salt Mines, up the ledges and to the\nright.",
"The lanterns still burn. Rest by one and\nit will remember you.",
"Press Up to use it. Pause with Start to\nsee your map on the lower screen.",
"I heard it! A bell! Faint, but true. Keep\ngoing, little warden.",
"Mind your head. The Foreman still\nworks his shift, and he does not know\nhe is dead.",
"His pit lies across the broken span. No\none jumps that far.",
"But there is a shrine left of here. The old\nones left a gift for fast feet.",
"The span is up the shaft and to the right.\nPress R in the air to rush.",
"Name? Date of drowning? No? Then I\ncannot help you. Sorry. Habit.",
"The belfry flooded years ago. The rope\nmen never let go of their ropes.",
"Below the rope walk there is a hook, for\nthose who must cross the bells.",
"Anchor rings hold a hook. Press L near\none. File that under useful.",
"Hah. That axe is dull and you swing it\nlike a broom.",
"Take what lies on my anvil. Hold Down\nand strike while falling.",
"Cracked floors will give way. My two\nbrothers are below. They share one\napron.",
"There is a cracked floor in the scrap\ntower. Fall hard and strike.",
"Shh. Up here we keep the quiet. It is all\nthat is left.",
"The Ringer took the voices so that\nnothing would hurt any more.",
"It meant well. That is the worst of it.\nTake the cloak. The wind will lift you\ntwice.",
"Jump again in the air. The last bell hangs\nabove the high shelf.",
"A: jump. B: axe. Hold A to jump higher.",
"Each hit fills your echo. Hold X on solid\nground to turn echo into health.",
"Down: drop through a ledge. Start:\npause and map.",
"Shift log, day 9,114. The bell has\nstopped. Work continues.",
"The water rose without a sound.\nNothing here makes a sound now.",
"We cast the last bell here. We gave it no\ntongue. It was told to wait.",
"When all is ringing, who will listen?\nWhen all is quiet, who will hurt?",
"You found the Rush. Press R to dart\nforward, on the ground or in the air.",
"You found the Hook. Press L near an\nanchor ring, or tap a ring on the lower\nscreen.",
"You found the Cleave. Hold Down and\npress B in the air to crash down and\nbreak cracked floors.",
"You found the Cloak of Wind. Press A in\nthe air to jump again.",
"A bell shard. It hums in your hands.\nMaximum health up.",
"A whetstone. The axe bites twice as\ndeep.",
"Shift... not... over.",
"The rope... must not... slacken.",
"Who comes? A customer! No, brother. A\nthief! Then we melt it.",
"The Anvil stands alone. It has waited a\nlong time to be struck.",
"Little one. Put it down. Listen. Isn't the\nquiet kind?",
"Somewhere far above, the first bell\nbegins to ring.",
"The rope goes slack. The second bell\nanswers the first.",
"The brothers fall quiet, and for once\nthey agree. The way on is open.",
"The Anvil splits. The third bell sounds\nthrough the iron. The way up is open.",
"The Ringer lays down its hands. The last\nbell hangs in front of you, silent.",
"Menuel takes the axe and strikes the\nbell itself.",
"The note rolls down the mountain,\nthrough iron and water and salt.",
"All across the Undertown, people\nremember their names.",
"The little warden sits down and listens\nfor a while.",
};
